### On-disk cache of rewritten OCI layers (litebox_packager::oci::cache) --
### keyed by (layer_digest, rewriter_version); safe to delete any time, a
### repeat boot just re-pulls+re-rewrites and repopulates it ###
/.litebox-cache/

### Stray local build/test artifacts (not committed products) ###
target-myfork/
alpine-fresh-test.tar

### Test-generated artifacts ###
litebox_runner_linux_on_windows_userland/tests/test-bins/*.hooked

### Local repro/debug scratch (packaged rootfs tarballs, gdb investigation sessions) ###
/alpine-rootfs.tar
/alpine-rootfs-fresh.tar
/layer_timeline*.tar
/.wfgy/
/pass_*.log
/pass_*.txt
/pass*.png
/litebox_frame_dump_*.bmp
/frame_dump/
/overlay*/

# Compiled guest probe binaries -- build with the host clang line in each .c file
/advisor/probes/xwire_probe
/advisor/probes/bigfork_probe
/advisor/probes/tramp_fork_probe

### Scratch scripts/layers injected into a guest run (--resume-from overlays, frame dumps, etc.) --
### these are throwaway build artifacts, never committed source; regenerate as needed
/probe_*.tar
/*.bmp
/*.log
